    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wuɔ̱c Yo-ci-yaa kɛ pa̱a̱l kuthni guäyni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär bööth Juda kɛnɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm diaal cɔal guäth kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär wä luaak Kuɔth Nhial, kɛɛl kɛ ji̱ Juda diaal kɛnɛ ji̱ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm diaal, kɛ bööth palä, kɛnɛ go̱o̱k kɛ nɛy diaal tin di̱t kɛnɛ tin tiɛtni. Kä cuɛ kɛ kuën rieet buɔk ŋuɔ̱tni diaal ca jek rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär cuɔ̱ŋ wääthä kä cuɛ mat ruac lat nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, kɛ ɣöö bɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni Kuoth Nhial, kä bɛ tit ni luëëkɛ kɛnɛ ŋuɔ̱tkɛ kɛ lɔcdɛ kɛɛliw, kɛnɛ ca̱rɛ kɛɛliw. Kɛ ɣöö bɛ rieet ŋuɔ̱tni ti ca gɔ̱r rɛy buɔk ɛmɛ la̱t. Kä cu nɛy diaal rɔ mat rɛy matdä ruacdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär ruac kɛ bo̱o̱th palä min di̱i̱t, kɛnɛ bööth palä tin kɔ̱ŋ, kɛ la̱a̱t thuɔk luaak, kɛ ɣöö ba kuak diaal tin te rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial tin ca la̱t kuoth Baal, kɛ Ä-ce-ra, kɛ tin la nyin nhial ka̱m raar rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial. Kä cuɛ kɛ waŋ raar Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm rɛy tɔ̱ɔ̱rä Kid-ron, kä cuɛ ŋɛ̈thdiɛn naŋ kä Beth-ɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ bööth palä kuthni guäyni woc tëë ca kuany ɛ kua̱r Juda kɛ ɣöö ba wal waŋ wi̱i̱ yi̱kni kuthni guäyni rɛy wi̱i̱ni Juda, kɛnɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. Amäni tin wa̱ŋkɛ kuoth Baal wal, kɛ cäŋ, kɛnɛ pay, kɛ nyin nhial diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Ä-ce-ra ka̱m raar rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä cuɛ jɛ naŋ lo̱o̱lä Kid-ron, kä cuɛ jɛ waŋ thi̱n, kä cuɛ nor, kä cuɛ ŋɛ̈thdɛ wä yiäk wuɔ̱thni muɔ̱ni nɛɛni ti duɛk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ duel palä kuthni guäyni min ca la̱t rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial däk, gua̱th in la män Ä-ce-ra a ko̱c thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ bööth palä diaal nööŋ raar wi̱i̱ni Juda, kä cua yi̱kni tin la wal a waŋkɛ thi̱n ya̱r, a känɛ jɛ ni kä Gabä amäni Ber-cɛ-ba. Kä cuɛ gua̱th pali kuthni guäyni da̱k piny ni thi̱ek in wäkɛ naath rɛc, cu mäni thi̱i̱k Jɔ-cua rueec wec min te kui̱ caam thiek wec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö /ken bööth palä guäyni ben wi̱i̱ yi̱kä Kuɔth Nhial kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. Ɛni ɣöö cam kɛn ni juray mi thil thuɔp kä gaatmani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ To-pɛth in te rɛy lo̱o̱lä gan I-nɔm ya̱r, kɛ ɣöö thilɛ ram mi bi gatdɛ kiɛ nyadɛ lɛ wa̱ŋ kuoth Mo-lɛk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jio̱o̱ktuɔ̱ruɔ̱k tin ca lëy kuoth ca̱ŋ ɛ kua̱r Juda woc, tin te thok luaak Kuɔth Nhial rɛy kal thieekä duëël läätdä ni Na-than. Kä cuɛ thurbil mi ca lëy kuoth ca̱ŋ waŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ yi̱k in te wi̱i̱ duëël A-ɣadh nhial, mëë la̱tkɛ ɛ kuäär Juda, kɛnɛ yi̱kni tëë ca la̱t ɛ Ma-na-thɛ rɛy käli luaak Kuɔth Nhial da̱ŋ rɛw da̱k piny, kä cuɛ tupdiɛn wä yuɔr ni rɛy waŋ Kid-ron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär gua̱th pali tin te kui̱ käny ca̱ŋ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm ya̱r, amäni kui̱c cuëëc pa̱a̱m nyuɔɔni, mëë tääth Thɔ-lo-mon kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ Ac-tar-te kuoth ji̱ Dhi-don, kɛnɛ Kɛ-moc kuoth ji̱ Mo-ab, kɛ Mil-kom kuoth ji̱ A-mon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ riäkni kɛ Ac-tar-te to̱l kä piny, kä cuɛ gua̱a̱thdiɛn duɔ̱l cɔ̱w nath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ yi̱k in te kä Beth-ɛl, kɛnɛ gua̱th palä mëë la̱tkɛ ɛ Ya-rɔ-baam gat Nɛ-bat mëë jak I-thɛ-rɛl kä dui̱r da̱k piny, cuɛ päämkiɛn nor ala tup. Kä cuɛ Ac-tar-te waŋ bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min guic Yo-ci-yaa cuɛ wuɔ̱th muɔ̱ni nɛn wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m. Cuɛ naath ja̱k kä cukɛ cɔ̱w ka̱m raar rɛy kɔ̱a̱kni, kä kɛ waŋ wi̱i̱ yi̱kä kä cuɛ kɛ ya̱r ce̱tnikɛ riet Kuɔth Nhial mëë ca lar ɛ raan Kuɔth, mëë lat ti̱ti̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär thiec i̱, “Ɛ wi̱c muɔ̱n ŋa ɛ nɔ nɛɛnä mɔ wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m?” Kä cu ji̱ wec ɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛ wi̱c muɔ̱ɔ̱n ran Kuɔth mi bä kä Juda mëë lat kɛn ti ci lät kä yi̱k Beth-ɛl ti̱.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wee, “A jɛ tey, a thil ram mi wooc cɔ̱wkɛ.” Kä cukɛ cɔ̱wkɛ päl kɛnɛ cɔ̱w go̱kä mëë bä kä Tha-mɛ-ria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yo-ci-yaa gua̱th pali kuthni guäyni diaal tëë ca la̱t rɛy wi̱i̱ni Tha-mɛ-ria ɛ kua̱r I-thɛ-rɛl tëë jak kɛ Kuoth Nhial kä gak. Cuɛ kɛ la̱t nikɛ lätni mëë cɛ lätni nyin Beth-ɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ bööth palä gua̱thni tɔ̱tɔ̱ näk wuɔ̱thni yi̱kni, kä cuɛ cɔ̱w nath waŋ wuɔ̱thnikiɛn. Kä cuɛ loc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ti̱em Yo-ci-yaa kɛ Cäŋ Bälä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär naath jiök i̱, “Tiɛmɛ cäŋ bälä Kuɔth Nhial Kuothdun, ce̱tkɛ min ca gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk matdä ruac ɛ mi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö thilɛ tiem ca̱ŋ bälä mi ca me̱t la̱t ni mëë ku Ruëëc I-thɛ-rɛl ruac, kiɛ kɛ ni̱n tëë ruec kua̱r I-thɛ-rɛl kɛnɛ Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö kɛ wäl bädäk runi ruëc Yo-ci-yaa cua ca̱ŋ bälä Kuɔth Nhial tim kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lät Yo-ci-yaa tin kɔ̱ŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yo-ci-yaa ti̱t, kɛ ji̱ kolaaŋni, kɛ kuth guäyni kɛ jiäk diaal tin te kä Juda kɛnɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm woc. Kä cuɛ la̱t ni riet ŋuɔ̱tni tin ca gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk ëë jek Ɣil-ki-yaa bo̱o̱th palä jɛ rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ thil kuäär mi ce̱tkɛ jɛ nhiamdɛ, mi cu rɔ riet Kuoth Nhial kɛ lɔcdɛ kɛɛliw, kɛnɛ ca̱rɛ kɛɛliw, kɛ buɔ̱mdɛ kɛɛliw, ce̱tnikɛ ŋuɔ̱t Muthɛ. Kä cuɛ thil ram mi ce̱tkɛ jɛ mi cu rɔ jiɛc kɔɔrɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gak Kuɔth Nhial in ci ben kä Juda ŋot /kenɛ thuɔ̱k, kɛ kui̱ kä tin diaal tëë ci Ma-na-thɛ jɛ jak kä gak kɛ kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial wee, “Ɣän bä Juda woc muun in cieŋä thi̱n bä, ce̱tnikɛ mëë cä I-thɛ-rɛl däk, kä bä wec ëë cä mɛk ni Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm yiäk, kɛnɛ duel ëë cä lar i̱ ba ɣä pal thi̱n.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thuɔ̱k ruëc Yo-ci-yaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua duɔth lätni Yo-ci-yaa diaal gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kuɛ̈ɛ̈ni kua̱ri Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ni̱nkɛ cu Pɛro Nɛko kuäär I-jëp kuäär A-thi-ri-ya ben luäk kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p kiɛr Yu-pɛ-ree-tidh",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:29",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yu-pɛ-ree-tidh",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kɛ thok ji̱ Ɣi-bɛ-ru cɔal kɛ jɛ i̱ kir Pɛ-rat.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Kä cu kuäär ni Yo-ci-yaa wä wëë röm kɛ jɛ kä mëë ci Pɛro Nɛko jɛ nɛn, cuɛ jɛ näk kä Mɛ-gi-do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu raan kɔarɛ ri̱ŋdɛ naŋ kɛ thurbil kä Mɛ-gi-do naŋɛ jɛ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä cuɛ jɛ wä kony kɔ̱kädɛ. Kä cu naath gatdɛ ni Yɛ-ɣo-a-ɣadh yi̱r ala kuäär kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ gua̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuäär Juda ni Yɛ-ɣo-a-ɣadh",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë took Yɛ-ɣo-a-ɣadh kuäär tëë kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ diɔ̱k, kä cuɛ ruëc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ päth diɔ̱k. Kä cɔalkɛ man i̱ Ɣä-mu-tɛ̈l nya ran Lib-na ni Yir-mɛ-yaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ la̱t ni jiäk waaŋ Kuɔth Nhial, ce̱tnikɛ tëë diaal tëë ci gua̱ni kɛ la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Pɛro Nɛko jɛ la̱th duëël yieenä därdɔaar muun Ä-math, kɛ ɣöö /cɛ bi ruëc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä cuɛ wec moc tho̱lbo̱k kɛ ki̱luni cikä min bo̱r ti bathdɔɔri diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ kur ŋuaan, kɛ ki̱luni dääpä ti jiɛn diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ ŋuaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Pɛro Nɛko Ɛl-ya-kim gat Yo-ci-yaa jak kä kuäär kɛ gua̱a̱th gua̱n, kä cuɛ ciötdɛ ri̱t i̱ Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kim. Kä cuɛ Yɛ-ɣo-a-ɣadh woc, cuɛ naŋ kä I-jëp, kä cuɛ wä li̱w ɛn wi̱ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kim ciɛk in bo̱r kɛ da̱a̱p ka̱m Pɛro, kä cuɛ yio̱w thol kä naath ce̱t ni min ci Pɛro ɛ la̱r jɛ. Kä cuɛ ciɛk in bo̱r kɛnɛ da̱a̱p thol kä ji̱ wec, cuɛ kɛ thol ce̱tkɛ pek nath, cuɛ kɛ ka̱m Pɛro Nɛko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
